# Calm / Anxiety — ~25 min — settle beat 12 Hz -> alpha 10 Hz hold -> soft fade (stays calm-alert)
# Goal: short, reliable "panic-button" alpha preset. Gentle binaural driver; light is calming
#   ambient only (NOT a driver). Effects often felt within 10-15 min.
# Bands: alpha ~10 Hz emphasis, brief 12 Hz settle. Binaural for anxiety g~=0.45 [E].
# Duration: 1,500,000 ms (~25 min). Audio ch1 binaural; LED mask 15 (four zones), steady.
# SAFETY (guidelines 4): NO visual flicker — LED held steady (freq 0), dim blue only, brightness
#   <=28% with a slow breathing LFO floored at 12% (never full black<->white), ramps in/out >=10 s.
#   Binaural carrier 370->372 Hz (<1000), L/R offset = beat <=12 Hz (<35). No red, no strobe.
# Technique (guidelines 5a): freq_r is NOT interpolatable -> hold freq_r = 382 FIXED and ramp the
#   carrier frequency 370 -> 372 Hz, so beat = freq_r - frequency slides 12 -> 10 Hz smoothly.
# Ramp convention = animate-on-start: '>' lives on the EARLIER entry (its value = start); the
#   target is the next same-channel entry's value, swept over the gap.

# --- t=0: session start -------------------------------------------------------
0 0 50 >0 0 60 180 5            # LED steady (freq 0); brightness >0 ramps toward next entry (->22%); dim blue
A 0 >370 0 >0 0 1 382 0          # ch1: carrier >370 ramps toward next freq; vol >0 fades toward next vol; freq_r 382 (beat 12); sine
S 3000 default 65 "Settling now at twelve hertz. Let your breathing slow, gently in and out."

# --- t=15 s: brightness ramp-in (>=10 s) complete -----------------------------
15000 0 50 22 0 60 180 5        # brightness 22% reached; steady dim blue

# --- t=30 s: breathing brightness LFO engages (sine 12<->28% / 10 s, ~6 breaths/min) ---
30000 0 50 ~12:28:10000 0 60 180 5   # gentle breathing; the only LED motion (no strobe, freq stays 0)

# --- t=45 s: volume fade-in (0->50 over 45 s) complete; carrier continues sliding ---
A 45000 >370.5 0 100 0 1 382 0    # vol 50 reached; carrier mid-slide (>370.5 -> next 372); beat ~11.5 Hz
S 45000 default 65 "Easing down toward alpha. There is nothing you need to do right now."

# --- t=3:00: alpha reached — carrier 372 vs fixed freq_r 382 => beat 10 Hz -----
A 180000 372 0 100 0 1 382 0      # carrier 372 (beat 10 Hz); steady blue + breathing; HOLD begins
S 180000 default 65 "You've reached alpha, ten hertz. Rest here, calm and safe. You are okay."

# --- HOLD 3:00 -> 24:30 (~21 min at alpha 10 Hz; dwell >> 6 min) ---------------
# No entries needed: carrier 372 / beat 10 Hz, vol 50, and the breathing LED all persist unchanged.
# Stays calm-alert alpha (no down-shift to theta) — this is not a bedtime preset.

# --- t=24:30: begin soft close (gentle, stays in alpha) -----------------------
A 1470000 372 0 >100 0 1 382 0    # carrier holds 372; vol >50 ramps toward 0 over the last 30 s
S 1470000 default 65 "Slowly returning now, still calm and clear. Carry this ease with you."
1470000 0 50 >12 0 60 180 5     # brightness >12 (LFO floor) ramps toward 0 over the last 30 s (>=10 s)

# --- t=25:00: end — audio and light at zero -----------------------------------
A 1500000 372 0 0 0 1 382 0      # carrier 372 (beat 10 Hz), volume 0
1500000 0 50 0 0 60 180 5       # brightness 0; session end
